Review complete. `REVIEW.json` written with 3 findings, all mechanically verified (quote-on-line, verbatim source quotes, rubric categories):

1. **`send-payment-reminder` — invented (major)**: a payment-reminder step after invoicing whose source quote ("The ERP sends a payment reminder after seven days.") appears nowhere in SOURCE.md, plus its two flows and lane reference.
2. **`Lane_warehouse` — wrong-authority (major)**: declared `authority="authority"` (automated system) though the source names the warehouse, a human department, as performer — AUTHORING.md §3 and the exemplar put departments in `sovereignty`.
